    "id": "w-u51-02",
    "unit": "u51",
    "prompt": "Mariana, your journalist friend, wasn't at the café yesterday. Write her a message explaining what vosotros is: that Lucía's friends used it, how it sounds, and what you would say instead. Quote at least one vosotros form (queréis, habéis, tenéis...) as an example of what you heard.",
