    "id": "w-u51-03",
    "unit": "u51",
    "prompt": "Vale is in Medellín for her trial month and wants to know everything about the morning. Lucía's group, who are from Spain, would say «hoy han llegado» and «han pedido». Tell Vale in the everyday Colombian way what the group did this morning, using the preterite (llegaron, pidieron...), and end by asking her when she comes back.",
