    "prompt": "Lucía has left a comment on your café's page: «Hoy he desayunado en vuestro café y he comprado un libro. ¡Qué rollo que me vaya mañana!» Answer her as Tomás. Tell her what you did this morning in the Colombian way (desayuné, fui...), and ask her one question about Spain.",
