    "id": "w-u51-05",
    "unit": "u51",
    "prompt": "Don Hernando, whom you address as usted, waited at his corner table yesterday to tell you a story from his taxi years, and you were out with Lucía's group. Write him a note of apology. Show your regret with at least one «si + hubiera/hubiese ... habría ...» sentence, and ask to meet again.",
